        "Source treatment shares, pressure assumptions, resource/return geography, losses, network, electricity, allocation, vintage and uncertainty differ. Native RER uses 0.00039 kWh of European electricity per kg; the earlier CH supplier uses 0.00042889 kWh of Swiss electricity. Regionalized water-stress or LCIA equivalence is not established; native biosphere exclusions and unquantified score effects remain warnings.",
